script = ExtResource("1_s")
id = "flood"
display_name = "Floods"
title = "Floods"
category = "The Earth"
order = 56
image = "res://art/guide/flood.png"
body = "Water rises. At the ankle it is a nuisance; at the knee it slows everything that walks and takes the dash away entirely, and every body standing in it is soaked - which makes lightning worse for them and chill faster.

You can still fight in it. You swing more slowly, not not at all: being unable to answer while the road keeps coming is a spectator seat, and this game does not hand those out.

A flood at its height leaves a basin behind, which is charged ground for the Water towers standing in it."
